sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant CT as Controller
    participant EA as Eligibility Agent
    participant RA as Retrieval Agent
    participant QD as Qdrant
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant SU as Summary Agent
    participant LLM as Groq / Gemini
    participant CI as Citation Validator

    FE->>CT: GET scheme detail
    CT->>PG: load scheme + rules
    CT->>EA: evaluate profile vs rules
    CT->>RA: get evidence
    RA->>PG: chunks cited by stored facts
    RA->>QD: top-k chunks for scheme
    RA-->>CT: deduplicated evidence
    CT->>SU: summarize(scheme, eligibility, evidence)
    SU->>LLM: evidence passages only, no profile
    alt LLM available
        LLM-->>SU: JSON sections + citation_ids
        SU->>CI: drop uncited sentences
    else LLM down
        SU->>PG: build summary from verified facts
    end
    SU-->>CT: cited summary + relevance from rules
    CT-->>FE: SchemeDetail + cited evidence
